/target
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# Cache entries are derived data, never committed. The leading `**/` matters:
# a pattern with a slash in the middle anchors to this file's directory, so a
# bare `.dankg/cache/` would miss the one under tests/data/corpus/.
**/.dankg/cache/

# `dankg tangle` output is wholly derived from the .md it was assembled
# from (architecture.org, Tangle > Output); the markdown is what's
# committed, never the generated tree.
**/.dankg/build/

# Sidecar manifest `dankg tangle` writes into src/ now that [tangle.rust]
# glue is configured (decision 28) -- consumed only by that glue command,
# never something to commit.
/src/.dankg-tangle-manifest.json
